  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial fork from original SmbAbstraction project. Updated framework and reference library support. Many breaking changes from original project: Case changes of class names, e.g. SMBFileSystem is now SmbFileSystem; Parameter order / method signature changes for main classes.",
